# If the chosen creature has left the battlefield, Close Encounter uses its power as it last existed there (the ruling; CR
# 608.2h). Bot1 chooses its Memnite (1/1) and targets Bot2's Aegis Turtle (0/5); Bot2 answers with Lightning Bolt on the
# Memnite. Close Encounter still deals the Turtle 1.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Mox Emerald
Memnite
Close Encounter
Forest x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Mox Ruby
Aegis Turtle
Lightning Bolt
Island x16

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Aegis Turtle.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Close Encounter.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Aegis Turtle)
Bot1.Choose(Choose creature you control or warped creature card you own in exile)
Bot1.Choose(Memnite)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Battlefield.Aegis Turtle.Damage = 1
Bot1.Graveyard = Close Encounter; Memnite
